---
layout: base.njk
title: Updates
---
<h1>Updates</h1>
<p>Also available as an <a href="/feed.xml">Atom feed</a>.</p>
<ul>
{%- for post in collections.updates | reverse %}
  <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a> — <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | isoDate | truncate(10, true, "") }}</time></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
